        "raw_output": "\n\nThe goal is to cook all raw meat using the grill and serve all cooked meat on the plate in the serving area. Currently, raw_meat_1 is in the grill_side_area, and the plate is in the dish_rack. The grill_lid is closed, so the inside_grill is inaccessible. To cook the raw meat, the grill_lid must be opened to access the inside_grill, then the raw meat must be placed inside for cooking, followed by closing the lid. After cooking, the lid must be opened again to retrieve the cooked meat. The plate must be moved to the serving_area before the cooked meat can be placed on it to satisfy the serving location requirement.\n\nAction sequence:\n1. Open the grill_lid to make the inside_grill accessible.\n2. Pick up raw_meat_1 from the grill_side_area.\n3. Place raw_meat_1 into the inside_grill for cooking.\n4. Close the grill_lid to cook the meat.\n5. Open the grill_lid again to access the cooked meat.\n6. Pick up the cooked meat (raw_meat_1) from the inside_grill.\n7. Place the cooked meat on the plate_top (top surface of the plate) while the plate is still in the dish_rack.\n8. Pick up the plate from the dish_rack.\n9. Place the plate (with cooked meat) into the serving_area to fulfill the serving location requirement.\n\nThis sequence ensures all raw meat is cooked and served on the plate in the serving area.\n\nFINAL ACTIONS:\nopen(grill_lid)\npick(raw_meat_1)\nplace(raw_meat_1, inside_grill)\nclose(grill_lid)\nopen(grill_lid)\npick(raw_meat_1)\nplace(raw_meat_1, plate_top)\npick(plate)\nplace(plate, serving_area)",
